rids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, November to December came in at 64% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 so far April to May sits at 58%. All 3 grids had their driest year in 1965, with grid 26036 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
